Today I am moving.
My new flat is in this building.
I am standing in my old room.
Almost everything is packed.
My shoes are standing under the chair.
I put the shoes on.
My backpack is standing next to the door.
The laptop is lying on the table.
I carefully pack the laptop into the backpack.
I close the backpack.
Where is the mobile phone?
It is lying on the bed.
I take the mobile phone with me.
The room is now completely empty.
My large suitcase is standing on the floor.
It is really very heavy.
I pull the suitcase into the hallway.
I lock the room door.
I am standing in the hallway next to the suitcase.
The way to my flat is short.
